#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:2
msgid "How to connect your Read the Docs account to your Git provider"
msgstr "如何将 Read the Docs 账户连接到 Git 服务商"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:4
msgid ""
"In this how to article, we cover how to connect an account on "
"|git_providers_or| with your Read the Docs account. This is relevant if you "
"have signed up for Read the Docs with your email or want to connect "
"additional providers."
msgstr ""
"本操作指南讲解如何将 |git_providers_or| 上的账户与你的 Read the Docs 账户关联。若你用邮箱注册了 Read the "
"Docs，或希望连接额外服务商，此文适用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:9
msgid ""
"If you are going to import repositories from |git_providers_or|, you should "
"connect your Read the Docs account to your Git provider first."
msgstr "若要从 |git_providers_or| 导入仓库，应先将 Read the Docs 账户连接到你的 Git 服务商。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:14
msgid ""
"If you signed up or logged in to Read the Docs with your |git_providers_or| "
"credentials, you're all done. Your account is connected ✅️. You only need "
"this how-to if you want to connect additional Git providers."
msgstr ""
"若你已用 |git_providers_or| 凭据注册或登录 Read the Docs，一切就绪，账户已关联 ✅️。只有想连接额外 Git "
"服务商时才需要本指南。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:19
msgid "Adding a connection"
msgstr "添加连接"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:21
msgid ""
"To connect your Read the Docs account with a Git provider, go to "
":menuselection:`<Username dropdown> --> Settings --> Connected services`."
msgstr ""
"要将 Read the Docs 账户与 Git 服务商关联，请前往 :menuselection:`<Username dropdown> --> "
"Settings --> Connected services` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:24
msgid ""
"From here, you'll be able to connect to your |git_providers_or| account. "
"This process will ask you to authorize an integration with Read the Docs."
msgstr "在那里你可以连接 |git_providers_or| 账户。该过程会要求你授权与 Read the Docs 的集成。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:27
msgid "Screenshot of example OAuth dialog on GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub OAuth 对话框示例截图"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:32
msgid "An example of how your OAuth dialog on GitHub may look."
msgstr "你的 GitHub OAuth 对话框可能的样式示例。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:34
msgid ""
"After approving the request, you will be taken back to Read the Docs. You "
"will now see the account appear in the list of connected services."
msgstr "批准请求后你会返回 Read the Docs，此时能在已连接服务列表中看到该账户。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:38
msgid ""
"Screenshot of Read the Docs \"Connected Services\" page with multiple "
"services connected"
msgstr "Read the Docs\"Connected Services\"页面（已连接多个服务）截图"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:43
msgid "Connected Services [#f1]_ [#f2]_ shows the list of Git providers that"
msgstr "Connected Services [#f1]_ [#f2]_ 列出 Git 服务商"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:45
msgid ""
"Now your connection is ready and you will be able to import and configure "
"Git repositories with just a few clicks."
msgstr "现在连接已就绪，你可以仅用几次点击就导入并配置 Git 仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:49
msgid ":doc:`/reference/git-integration`"
msgstr ":doc:`/reference/git-integration`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:50
msgid ""
"Learn how the connected account is used for automatically configuring Git "
"repositories and Read the Docs projects and which **permissions** that are "
"required from your Git provider."
msgstr "了解关联账户如何用于自动配置 Git 仓库和 Read the Docs 项目，以及需要 Git 服务商提供哪些**权限** 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:54
msgid "Removing a connection"
msgstr "移除连接"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:56
msgid ""
"You may at any time delete the connection from Read the Docs. Delete the "
"connection makes Read the Docs forget the immediate access, but you should "
"also disable our OAuth Application from your Git provider."
msgstr ""
"你可以随时从 Read the Docs 删除该连接。删除连接会让 Read the Docs 失去即时访问权限，但你还应在 Git 服务商处停用我们的"
" OAuth 应用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:60
msgid "On GitHub, navigate to `Authorized OAuth Apps`_."
msgstr "在 GitHub 上前往 `Authorized OAuth Apps`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:61
msgid "On Bitbucket, navigate to `Application Authorizations`_."
msgstr "在 Bitbucket 上前往 `Application Authorizations`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/connecting-git-account.rst:62
msgid "On GitLab, navigate to `Applications`_"
msgstr "在 GitLab 上前往 `Applications`_"

